How to run it
For this demonstration, use a local test application that accepts a q parameter.

Run:
python xss_test_runner.py --url http://127.0.0.1:8000/search


The results will be saved in:
results/xss-results.csv

Example output:
Test ID	HTTP status	Raw marker reflected
XSS-001	200	Yes
XSS-002	403	No
XSS-003	200	No
XSS-004	403	No
XSS-005	200	Yes

Illustrative results only, not actual test results.
